{
 "about": "Exact input and output pairs of the fleet placement policy. Written from src/fleet_policy.mjs and checked against the assertions of the Rust tests named in rust_test (eustress/crates/forge/src/fleet.rs). Field names are the serde names of fleet.rs; config is FleetConfig::default() unless a case overrides it.",
